#only("3")[#voiceover("Option c) one-third is also incorrect for the same reason. The correct multiplication results in one-half, not one-third.")]
#only("4")[#voiceover("Finally, option d) one-sixth is incorrect because the multiplication of two-thirds by three-fourths simplifies to one-half, not one-sixth.")]
